{"id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-code-consistency.md","title":"按证明码上界截断的一致性句","display":"df-finite-code-consistency — 按证明码上界截断的一致性句","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-code-consistency","aliases":["72-df-finite-code-consistency"],"display":"df-finite-code-consistency — 按证明码上界截断的一致性句","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §6, print577–579/PDF589–591; local code-bound variant of finite consistency","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"bounded code-quantifier formula and source-variant distinction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"分开理论输入 T 与编码元组 κ 的类型"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-code-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-code-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-code-consistency — 按证明码上界截断的一致性句"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §6, print577–579/PDF589–591; local code-bound variant of finite consistency"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"bounded code-quantifier formula and source-variant distinction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"分开理论输入 T 与编码元组 κ 的类型"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a> 的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>、理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E}(T)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E}(T)\\)</span>、Prf 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_N\">\\(\\bot_N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1,x_2\">\\(x_0,x_1,x_2\\)</span> 是互异数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为该语言数项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{T,\\kappa}\">\\(C_{T,\\kappa}\\)</span> 是下式定义的单自由变量公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t)\\)</span> 使用既有捕获避免代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{T,\\kappa}:=\\forall x_0\\bigl[x_0&lt;x_2\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)})\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{T,\\kappa}:=\\forall x_0\\bigl[x_0&lt;x_2\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)})\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t):=C_{T,\\kappa}[t/x_2].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t):=C_{T,\\kappa}[t/x_2].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处限制证明码 p&lt;n，而原书通常限制证明长度≤n；两者都只有有限多个候选，但数值上界不能混同。明确标为本地码界变体，不对它套用书中关于长度截断的一致性证明大小下界。公式已绑定证明码变量，且项代入可以自动避开捕获。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的数语法模式 $\\iota=1$、理论 $T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E}$ 和 $\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E}(T)$、Prf 与 $\\bot_N$。$x_0,x_1,x_2$ 是互异数变量，$t$ 为该语言数项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_N","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,x_1,x_2","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"C_{T,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"C_{T,\\kappa}:=\\forall x_0\\bigl[x_0<x_2\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)})\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(t):=C_{T,\\kappa}[t/x_2].","display":true}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-549","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"2a2a5f632a428dbe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"T、κ 为 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] 的数语法接口，$\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)$ 成立；$\\mathsf{PRA}$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]，其语言包含检查程序对应的 PR 函数及定义方程。n∈ω。"},{"id":"7d6a6dd48825bc92","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"T、κ 取 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]，且 $\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T$。HBL、FP、Con 取 [[72-lem-second-incompleteness]] 及其上游；使用同一数语法演算。"}],"outgoing":["4c14656043bc77c1"]}